TITLE Calcite kinetics, pH 2 (set by acid), 200C, Cu and Ba, pe 4

SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH   2
    pe   4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu   10
    Ba   5
    Cl   25  charge

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0    1
        -m     1
        -parms 1.0  1.0  10
        -steps 1000 in 100
        -tol 1e-12

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file calcite_kin.sel
    -reset false
    -pH true

END
